[*]
[*] GTKWave save file: PTP timestamping view for test_fpga_core (run_test_ptp)
[*] Generate the trace with:  make SIM=verilator WAVES=1 TESTCASE=run_test_ptp
[*]   (remove sim_build first if the last build was without WAVES=1)
[*] Open from this dir:         gtkwave ptp_test.fst ptp.gtkw
[*] Markers (run_test_ptp on its own, rx_clk 200 ppm faster than clk):
[*]   A both CDCs locked  B first PTP frame starts on XGMII RX  C it reaches the engine port
[*]   D first PTP frame from the engine starts on XGMII TX  E its TX timestamp comes out
[*] Timestamps are 96 bit, shown in hex: 12 digits seconds, 8 digits ns, 4 digits fractional ns
[*]
